eNPCMsg",["msg_0345_R10R0202_00019"]],["End",[]]]},"messages":{"msg_0345_R10R0202_00000":"A thief broke into the Power Plant...\\nWhat is the world coming to?","msg_0345_R10R0202_00001":"I just got word from Cerulean.\\nIt appears that a shady character has\\fbeen loitering around.\\r","msg_0345_R10R0202_00002":"Could I ask for your cooperation?\\rThe shady character was hanging around\\nthe Cerulean Gym...\\r","msg_0345_R10R0202_00003":"Could I ask for your cooperation?\\rThe shady character was hanging around\\nthe Cerulean Gym...","msg_0345_R10R0202_00004":"Someone made off with a part that’s\\nessential for the generator.\\rWithout it, the new generator’s\\nuseless!","msg_0345_R10R0202_00005":"This Power Plant had been abandoned in\\nthe past.\\rWe got it back up and running to provide\\npower to the Magnet Train.","msg_0345_R10R0202_00006":"The Power Plant’s Manager is up ahead.\\rBut since someone wrecked the\\ngenerator, he’s been both sad and,\\fat times, furious...\\rSometimes he would burst out laughing\\nout of desperation.\\fWe’ve had to go through so much...","msg_0345_R10R0202_00007":"The Magnet Train consumes a lot\\nof electricity.\\rIt can’t move if the new generator\\nisn’t operating.","msg_0345_R10R0202_00008":"I collect Pokémon.\\nDo you have a DUGTRIO?\\rWant to trade it for my MAGNETON? {YESNO 0}","msg_0345_R10R0202_00009":"Yay! I got myself a DUGTRIO!\\nThanks!","msg_0345_R10R0202_00010":"Huh? That’s not DUGTRIO.\\nWhat a letdown...","msg_0345_R10R0202_00011":"You don’t want to trade? Aww...","msg_0345_R10R0202_00012":"Hi, how’s my old MAGNETON doing?","msg_0345_R10R0202_00013":"Manager: I-I-I’m ready to blast\\nsomething!\\rWho would dare steal a part from the\\ngenerator?\\rI spent so much time fixing it!\\nIf I catch him, he’s going to see\\fwhat I can do with my Charge Beam!","msg_0345_R10R0202_00014":"Manager: Ah! Yeah!\\nThe thing you have...\\rIs that the part that was stolen from\\nmy beloved generator?\\rYou found it?\\nThank you so much!\\rNow, all I have to do is...\\nattach this part here...\\r","msg_0345_R10R0202_00015":"Manager: Whirrrrrr!\\rYes, it’s running!\\nWhirrr, whirrr!\\r","msg_0345_R10R0202_00016":"Manager: Wahah! Thanks!\\rHere! Go ahead and take this TM\\nas a reward!\\r","msg_0345_R10R0202_00017":"Manager: TM57 is my Charge Beam!\\rIt will shoot beams, and it can also\\nsometimes raise Special Attack!","msg_0345_R10R0202_00018":"Staff Mottos:\\r1. Electricity is not infinite.\\n2. Conserve wherever possible.\\f3. Watch out for each other.\\f4. Idle hands are not allowed.\\f5. Wear shoes with rubber soles.\\f6. The Manager is awesome.","msg_0345_R10R0202_00019":"Use electricity wisely\\nfor a bright and pleasant life.\\f           Kanto Power Plant"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_R10R0202_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_R10R0202_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_R10R0202_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_R10R0202_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_R10R0202_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_R10R0202_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_R10R0202_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_R10R0202_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_R10R0202_008":8,"_EV_scr_seq_R10R0202_009":9,"obj_R10R0202_policeman":0,"obj_R10R0202_gsassistantm":1,"obj_R10R0202_gsassistantm_2":2,"obj_R10R0202_policeman_2":3,"obj_R10R0202_gsassistantm_3":4,"obj_R10R0202_gsassistantm_4":5,"obj_R10R0202_gsbigman":6}}
